11A. CommunityReport

A CommunityReport shall preserve: source/provenance, reporter reference where permitted, hazard type, media object references, GeoJSON location, capture/submission timestamps, geolocation accuracy, nearby slope/road/asset associations, verification state, confidence/evidence references, duplicate cluster ID where applicable, moderation state, and audit history.

11B. CommunityEventCluster

A CommunityEventCluster groups spatially/temporally related public observations while retaining each source report as an independent record. It shall support report count, independent contributor count, verification summary, centroid/impact geometry, and linked operational event where created.

