14. Competitive/Novelty Guardrails

Do not claim as unique merely because Sentinel NER combines known technologies such as:

rainfall thresholds;

susceptibility mapping;

IoT sensors;

satellite monitoring;

generic evacuation routing;

generic ML prediction;

generic cell-broadcast messaging.

The product's differentiation should emphasize the integrated operational chain:

change → risk → consequence → responsible actor → deadline → authorized action → outcome → audit/learning

with NER-specific lifeline analysis, degraded-connectivity operation, and separate forecast/interception workflows.

15. Release Criteria

A production release requires:

passing automated test suite;

security checks completed;

database/index review completed;

backup/restore test completed;

observability enabled;

deployment reproducible;

rollback documented/tested;

accessibility review completed;

external integrations have explicit health/failure states;

no fake operational data in production;

model limitations documented;

runbooks available.